<title>USA: CompUSA opens 2 new superstores, 25 planned for '97.</title>
<headline>CompUSA opens 2 new superstores, 25 planned for '97.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Computer retailer CompUSA Inc on Thursday said it will open new Superstores in Bellevue, Wash., and Gaithersburg, Md., on December 6.</p>
<p>Company spokeswoman Carol Elfstrom told Reuters that the firm plans to open 25 to 30 new stores in the U.S. in the next calendar year.</p>
<p>Including the two new locations, CompUSA currently operates 121 superstores in 54 metropolitan markets.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
